        "parents": [
          {
            "commit": "450b9dc6c46a9649174c6217142a938dbc1ee5c4",
            "subject": "LU-20305 tcu: fix errors when deleting remote dirs under a shard"
          }
        ],
        "author": {
          "name": "Emoly Liu",
          "email": "emoly@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-07-19 00:49:42.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Emoly Liu",
          "email": "emoly@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-07-19 00:49:42.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-20487 tcu: allow getxattr on virtual STCU objects",
        "message": "LU-20487 tcu: allow getxattr on virtual STCU objects\n\nWith TCU + remote dir, a concurrent trash move/destroy can clear\nLOHA_EXISTS while a client close/getxattr is in flight. This will\ncause object existence assertion failure in mdt_getxattr().\n\nTo fix this issue, use lu_object_accessible() in mdt_getattr()\ninstead of lu_object_exists(), just like mdt_getattr() does.\n\nTest-Parameters: fstype=ldiskfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 testlist=sanityn.sh\nTest-Parameters: fstype=ldiskfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 testlist=sanityn.sh env=ONLY=118y,ONLY_REPEAT=100\nSigned-off-by: Emoly Liu <emoly@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I3444d7c6b4f18883dbb00f7896c2469db32f52af\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
